          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సంపద (sampada) is borrowed from Sanskrit sampad, \"success\" (CDIAL 12932), which Monier-Williams also glosses \"accomplishment, perfection\"; Telugu uses it for wealth."
            }
